      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "Anti-patterns",
      "prov:value": "- **Restarting every stalled agent at once.** That is a swarm, and it needs\n  the owner's yes ([`swarm-management`](swarm-management.md)), plus disk and\n  CPU headroom: four agents regenerating at once filled a 9 GB allowance on\n  2026-10-02.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-10-02"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-10-02"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/stalled-agent-triage.md#provenance-2",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "0. Bidirectional Relay Continuity (Write-Ahead Readiness ↔ Returning Re-Entry)",
      "prov:value": "Owner directive (2026-11-28): keep the active stability/coordination epic continuously updated at dispatch time with new beans, active research and compute hypotheses, excluded routes, and worktree leases so another agent can take over immediately on a stall, and ensure returning agents reconcile default-branch commits, pending PRs, active/stalled work items, and local worktrees non-destructively before resuming.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-11-28"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-11-28"
      ]
    }
  ]
